        "blog_editorial_callout_section_m8PFU4": {
          "type": "blog--editorial-callout-section",
          "settings": {
            "container_width": 1100,
            "left_column_width": 45,
            "right_column_width": 55,
            "column_gap": 50,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What this means when you are shopping",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "mobile_heading_size": 28,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_indent": 0,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 0,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/magnific_luxury-perfume-comparison_74h5S6MJAL_jpg.jpg",
            "image_max_width": 500,
            "heading_image_gap": 16,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 20,
            "body_text": "<p>Autumn is the perfect time to experiment with spraying natural textiles. Wool, cashmere, and denim hold base notes like cedar, amber, and vanilla remarkably well without altering their scent profile.</p><p>Give the inside lining of your favorite autumn jacket or scarf a light spray from 8 inches away—you will enjoy gentle whiffs of luxury every time you put it on.</p>",
            "body_font": "system_ui_n4",
